1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:04:34,479
Mira: Last year, I wrote a short văn bản about Vietnamese Tet. But no one believed that a Russian like me could hiểu your culture.

2
00:04:34,529 --> 00:10:58,800
Michael: Really? I'd love to read that văn bản. Tet is a special kỳ nghỉ for us Vietnamese. But I think someone smart like you can hiểu any culture.

3
00:10:58,850 --> 00:15:33,329
Mira: Don't flatter me! That văn bản was just a small exercise. But... if you really want to read it, I can send it to you. I also wrote about the Russian kỳ nghỉ Maslenitsa. Do you know about that?

4
00:15:33,379 --> 00:20:07,858
Michael: I've never heard of Maslenitsa. But I love learning about kỳ nghỉ from other cultures. Perhaps... instead of just reading your văn bản, we could experience some traditional celebrations together? I know a Russian restaurant in District 1...

5
00:20:07,908 --> 00:21:02,803
Mira: Are you... asking me out? Russian restaurants in Saigon usually don't have the right flavor. I could cook traditional blini for Maslenitsa. But don't misunderstand! This is not a date...

